    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6620" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căpistro</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">āvi</span></b> ), ātum, 1,
			v. a.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To halter</i>, <i>tie with a
			halter</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jumenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 19, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 19, 49, § 177</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 2,
			80</span></i>; Sid, Carm. 22, 23.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of the vine, <i>to
				bind fast</i>, <i>to fasten</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 11,
				2, 95</span></i>.</div>
